    "CoiStatement": "Compliance with Ethical Standards This study was funded by Bayer AG, Leverkusen, Germany, and performed by M.A.R.C.O., Dusseldorf, Germany, an independent institute for clinical research and statistics. During the development of this manuscript, Samantha Forder was completing a post-doctoral fellowship through a partnership between Bayer and Rutgers University, New Brunswick, NJ, USA. Michael Voelker is a full-time employee of Bayer AG. Angel Lanas is supported by the University of Zaragoza, Zaragoza, Spain. Dr. Lanas has received honoraria for participation in advisory boards and for a previous related study from Bayer. All authors contributed sufficiently to the development, review, and revision of this manuscript.",
    "Article": {
